WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/charging/components/charging-list/AcDcStatsPanel.tsx — a PURE presentational leaf fed a
  computed `breakdown: AcDcBreakdown` prop by its parent (the Charging page). Regions:
    GlassPanel(p-5) → h3.section-title[ <Zap text-neon-amber/> + "Charging Stats by Type" ]
                    → Energy-split bar: label "Energy Split (AC vs DC)"; a two-column grid bar whose AC
                      (bg-blue-500) / DC (bg-amber-500) segments each render ONLY when `bucket.energy > 0`,
                      sized `(bucket.energy / total.energy) * 100%`, captioned `AC/DC {fmtPercent(pct)}`;
                      beneath it the AC / Total / DC kWh-or-MWh totals.
                    → DataTable (compact, paginated) with eight columns — type · sessions · energy · cost ·
                      $/kWh · avg energy · avg time · free — over the rows `[ac, dc].filter(count > 0)`.
                    → Free-charging footer, shown only when `breakdown.total.freeCount > 0`.
  Data sources: `useTranslation` only. No data hooks; no loading/empty/error/stale/offline branches at the leaf
  (those are owned by the parent surface that computes + feeds the breakdown) — the leaf's own variation is the
  energy>0 segment gating, the count>0 row filter, the freeCount>0 footer, and the empty DataTable render.
  Formatting helpers it consumes: fmtPercent / fmtWithUnit / fmtNumber (numberFormat.ts, global precision 2,
  safeNumber⇒0) and formatDurationMinutes (dateFormat.ts).

